{"data": [{"author_id": "881167405573038090", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:07:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116079576011231481"], "id": "2116079576011231481", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 186, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在年出生人口八九百万，2050年左右他们会进入社会然后交的社保给现在40岁左右的人养老。\n但是现在40岁左右的人当初每年出生人口在2000万左右\n\n那么就是说2050的时候面临的问题是800万人交社保给2000万人养老，这个问题怎么破？", "url": "https://x.com/Gaoxinggang/status/2116079576011231481"}, {"author_id": "1892261573328277504", "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:22:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116445688699699318"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/X8A1YkUrRc", "end": 58, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Hillprot777/status/2116445688699699318/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116445665727504384", "start": 35, "url": "https://t.co/X8A1YkUrRc"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/X8A1YkUrRc", "end": 58, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Hillprot777/status/2116445688699699318/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116445666671304704", "start": 35, "url": "https://t.co/X8A1YkUrRc"}]}, "id": "2116445688699699318", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国\n2025年出生人口断崖式下降，已经低于抗战时期的1942年了！ https://t.co/X8A1YkUrRc", "url": "https://x.com/Hillprot777/status/2116445688699699318"}, {"author_id": "1683661862603456513", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:49:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116376938453561545", "2116377183510000024"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/moeKafuuChino/…", "end": 87, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/moeKafuuChino/status/2116367135345926611", "start": 64, "url": "https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH"}]}, "id": "2116376938453561545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116367135345926611", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "按出生人口推算的话 高校毕业生人数每年都会增加喵.....\n\n2016-2017高点出生的人\n2038-2039本科毕业喵.. https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH", "url": "https://x.com/shenxianovo/status/2116376938453561545"}, {"author_id": "1754072461212344320", "created_at": "2026-10-31T10:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116473000983724479"], "id": "2116473000983724479", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 149, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国出生人口一路在掉，广东一个省，还稳稳站在 100 万以上\n\n遥遥领先第二名\n\n谁知道，这是为什么？", "url": "https://x.com/Qian888jin/status/2116473000983724479"}, {"author_id": "1589223774733279232", "created_at": "2026-10-30T16:14:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116202019363189008"], "id": "2116202019363189008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "前几天看到一份中国新出生人口性别的信息，大陆政府真的不考虑支持同性恋吗？男性婴儿占比那么高。", "url": "https://x.com/qdzb12345/status/2116202019363189008"}, {"author_id": "2070722035781910528", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:11:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116533530377572641"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 49, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 44, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2116533530377572641", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 385, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2025年万圣节今天做爱的有多少人没带套？请你根据出生人口怀孕率，反推出多少人没带套？ @grok 仅需中国即可", "url": "https://x.com/Nnnxq3j/status/2116533530377572641"}, {"author_id": "18800657", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:29:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116432325001285682"], "id": "2116432325001285682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 394, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "全国每出生8个孩子，\n大约就有1个出生在广东。\n\n2025年，广东出生人口100.3万，\n连续多年位居全国第一。\n\n广东还是有钱，\n现在有钱人才愿意生孩子。", "url": "https://x.com/chaoxiao/status/2116432325001285682"}, {"author_id": "2109197781206482944", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:29:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116085115818574078"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 62, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 57, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2116085115818574078", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 496, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "同样都是人口大国\n\n为什么印度是女的出彩礼？\n\n在中国出生人口急剧下滑的情况下，未来是否可能出台法律杜绝彩礼？\n\n@grok 如实回答不绕弯", "url": "https://x.com/simonluosa/status/2116085115818574078"}, {"author_id": "1683661862603456513", "created_at": "2026-10-31T03:50:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116376938453561545", "2116377183510000024"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/moeKafuuChino/…", "end": 116, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/moeKafuuChino/status/2116367135345926611", "start": 93, "url": "https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH"}]}, "id": "2116377183510000024", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 381, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116367135345926611", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "按出生人口推算的话 高校毕业生人数每年都会增加喵.....\n\n2016-2017高点出生的人\n2038-2039本科毕业喵..\n\n就算92学历并且大学能刷两段实习的...也比较艰难喵😭 https://t.co/QzHhlMwcZH", "url": "https://x.com/shenxianovo/status/2116377183510000024"}, {"author_id": "1212698226194702338", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:59:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116107648018096182"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IuBIw2MX40", "end": 34, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Gilly64574971/status/2116107648018096182/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116107631580602368", "start": 11, "url": "https://t.co/IuBIw2MX40"}]}, "id": "2116107648018096182", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今年能有750万吗？ https://t.co/IuBIw2MX40", "url": "https://x.com/Gilly64574971/status/2116107648018096182"}, {"author_id": "2033088582513209344", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:04:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116093841384362086"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mhp1lSPcC1", "end": 158, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/svx1011733/status/2116093841384362086/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116093816054968320", "start": 135, "url": "https://t.co/mhp1lSPcC1"}, {"display_url": "x.com/ntrhunter_dog/…", "end": 182, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ntrhunter_dog/status/2115749612304892134", "start": 159, "url": "https://t.co/KtpgUtaIPb"}]}, "id": "2116093841384362086", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 47, "impression_count": 8632, "like_count": 343, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 13}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115749612304892134", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "腊孝子经典自己立个稻草人自己打，有没有可能史学界一直都是把少出生人口和非正常死亡人口分开计算的，茅于轼用拟合人口减实际人口，得到差额 5259 万，然后扣掉少出生的 1624 万，剩下约 3635 万才算死亡，曹树基的 3245 万，是用 1953、1964、1982 https://t.co/mhp1lSPcC1 https://t.co/KtpgUtaIPb", "url": "https://x.com/svx1011733/status/2116093841384362086"}, {"author_id": "1474543955266183170", "created_at": "2026-10-30T13:17:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116157616401346942"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/threerights1/s…", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/threerights1/status/2116146961485377996", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/uTfhyCjHES"}]}, "id": "2116157616401346942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116146961485377996", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "爱国粉红们，你们老是为东大的GDP骄傲\n\n算算你手里的钱多了吗？工资涨了吗？房价缩水了吗？财富多了吗？社保交得起吗？养老有保障吗？\n\n2025年中国65岁以上的人口已经超过14岁以下的儿童，未富先老。\n\n2025年出生人口断崖式下降，已经低于抗战时期的1942年了！ https://t.co/uTfhyCjHES", "url": "https://x.com/Jade777666/status/2116157616401346942"}, {"author_id": "1984623209707384832", "created_at": "2026-10-31T11:05:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116486834561945970"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3AZaGJuFep", "end": 143, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/8964TianAnMens/status/2116486834561945970/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116486826215211008", "start": 120, "url": "https://t.co/3AZaGJuFep"}]}, "id": "2116486834561945970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 752, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "中共：全世界还没有任何一个国家有养老金崩盘的先例，那我们就崩一个给你们看看，这不就有先例了\n\n话说回来，中共在世界上创造的先例还少吗？六年出生人口减半，房地产五年腰斩等等人类奇迹，简直多得不胜枚举，再多崩一个养老金有什么可奇怪的？顺手的事 https://t.co/3AZaGJuFep", "url": "https://x.com/8964TianAnMens/status/2116486834561945970"}, {"author_id": "1308812956386369541", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:35:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116146886088491222", "2116146961485377996"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LXja4UCfAG", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/threerights1/status/2116146961485377996/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116144594630905856", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/LXja4UCfAG"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/LXja4UCfAG", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/threerights1/status/2116146961485377996/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116145747124948992", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/LXja4UCfAG"}, {"display_url": "x.com/threerights1/s…", "end": 181, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/threerights1/status/2114317789863559262", "start": 158, "url": "https://t.co/DrBsNGdjLR"}]}, "id": "2116146961485377996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 3970, "like_count": 142, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 111}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114317789863559262", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "爱国粉红们，你们老是为东大的GDP骄傲\n\n算算你手里的钱多了吗？工资涨了吗？房价缩水了吗？财富多了吗？社保交得起吗？养老有保障吗？\n\n2025年中国65岁以上的人口已经超过14岁以下的儿童，未富先老。\n\n2025年出生人口断崖式下降，已经低于抗战时期的1942年了！ https://t.co/LXja4UCfAG https://t.co/DrBsNGdjLR", "url": "https://x.com/threerights1/status/2116146961485377996"}, {"author_id": "1308812956386369541", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:35:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116146886088491222", "2116146961485377996"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kkBwyxx94T", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/threerights1/status/2116146886088491222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116144594630905856", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/kkBwyxx94T"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kkBwyxx94T", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/threerights1/status/2116146886088491222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116145747124948992", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/kkBwyxx94T"}, {"display_url": "x.com/threerights1/s…", "end": 180, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/threerights1/status/2114317789863559262", "start": 157, "url": "https://t.co/DrBsNGdjLR"}]}, "id": "2116146886088491222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114317789863559262", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "小粉红们，你们老是为东大的GDP骄傲\n\n算算你手里的钱多了吗？工资涨了吗？房价缩水了吗？财富多了吗？社保交得起吗？养老有保障吗？\n\n2025年中国65岁以上的人口已经超过14岁以下的儿童，未富先老。\n\n2025年出生人口断崖式下降，已经低于抗战时期的1942年了！ https://t.co/kkBwyxx94T https://t.co/DrBsNGdjLR", "url": "https://x.com/threerights1/status/2116146886088491222"}, {"author_id": "135732488", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:20:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116581193294794844"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/KELMAND1/statu…", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/KELMAND1/status/2115992358169022830", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/PvZ5CVJ0FS"}]}, "id": "2116581193294794844", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115992358169022830", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "那个1983年的年鉴本来就是特定背景下出来的（为否定路线，降低改革阻力）\n因为根据2000年五普数据，1960年出生且活到了40岁的人口还有 1468万人，比1983年的年鉴上的当年出生人口多几百万。\n年鉴上的出生率被证实是不准的，那么它记录的死亡率你相信是准的吗？\n那其它所有基于这个年鉴的研究结果？呵呵 https://t.co/PvZ5CVJ0FS", "url": "https://x.com/iviso/status/2116581193294794844"}, {"author_id": "2104757028547895296", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115911554948313549"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4NHNkFWpzA", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/0x_SunXiaomei/status/2115911554948313549/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115868745612836865", "start": 133, "url": "https://t.co/4NHNkFWpzA"}]}, "id": "2115911554948313549", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 901, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国社保大概率会崩盘：\n\n1老龄化加剧，领养老金人越来越多\n 2出生人口锐减，未来缴费人口减少  3收支失衡，缴费增长赶不上支出 \n4财政压力巨大，养老金对财政补贴的依赖增加 \n5地区差异严重，部分地区养老支付压力巨大  6就业不稳定，灵活就业、低收入影响持续缴费 https://t.co/4NHNkFWpzA", "url": "https://x.com/0x_SunXiaomei/status/2115911554948313549"}, {"author_id": "2108212238473375744", "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:02:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116017946480742413"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VuDFkX4ldd", "end": 148, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/love2cai/status/2116017946480742413/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116017442291879936", "start": 125, "url": "https://t.co/VuDFkX4ldd"}]}, "id": "2116017946480742413", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 159542, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "让你们再谈论社保，《人民日报》10月29日晚发文，批评“年轻人养不起老人了”“养老金要崩盘”等言论挑动对立、制造焦虑。\n\n但文章同时明确解释：中国基本养老保险实行“社会统筹+个人账户”，当前缴费的一部分先用于支付当前退休人员养老金，即“现收现付”。 https://t.co/VuDFkX4ldd", "url": "https://x.com/love2cai/status/2116017946480742413"}, {"author_id": "1888168367950831616", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:44:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116269972305449031"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oGodoW42KQ", "end": 144, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yngk346722/status/2116269972305449031/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116269968694079488", "start": 121, "url": "https://t.co/oGodoW42KQ"}]}, "id": "2116269972305449031", "public_metrics": {"boo